CasketDB runs Lua scripts with these Go modules:

github.com/acneism/lua, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its
NOTICE and LICENSES directory list the code it adapts from Lua 5.1, Redis and
the Redis Lua libraries, under the MIT and BSD licenses.

github.com/acneism/lua-libm, licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2.1 or later. It provides the trigonometric functions of Lua
scripts, translated from the IBM Accurate Mathematical Library in GNU libc 2.39.
Its source is at https://github.com/acneism/lua-libm. To use a modified version,
point go.mod at it with a replace directive and rebuild CasketDB from its source
at https://github.com/acneism/casketdb.

The container image keeps the license and notice files of CasketDB, of these
modules and of github.com/acneism/raft in /licenses.